# TCP/IP Model

4 Layers

- Application
- Transport
- Internet
- Network Access

This is the model actually used on the Internet.

---

# TCP vs UDP

TCP

- Reliable
- Connection-oriented
- Error checking

Used for:
- Banking
- Email
- Web browsing

---

UDP

- Fast
- Connectionless
- No guarantee of delivery

Used for:
- Streaming
- Gaming
- VoIP

